        {
            "parameters": {
                "content": "## Agent - Diagnosis Workflow 🩺\n\nThis workflow automates vehicle diagnosis:\n\n1.  **Workflow Trigger**: Initiates the workflow, receiving a `vehicle_id` as input.\n2.  **Select Vehicle Data**: Fetches the latest 10 records for the specified `vehicle_id` from the `cleaned_vehicle_data` table.\n3.  **GPT-4o Model**: Provides the language model (GPT-4o) for the AI Agent, configured to output JSON.\n4.  **Diagnosis Agent**: Analyzes the vehicle data and predicts failure probabilities for components, outputting the results as JSON.\n5.  **Insert Predicted Issues**: Stores the AI-generated predicted issues into the `predicted_issues` database table.\n6.  **Check Severity**: Evaluates the predicted issues. If any issue has a \"HIGH\" severity, it triggers a flag for customer outreach. ",
                "height": 450,
                "width": 500,
                "color": 5
            },
